Cryptographic provenance: each piece of output produced under the
agent protocol defined in `protocol/` carries an Ed25519 signature
bound to the agent identity declared in `agent/identity.json`. The
signature is verifiable via `tools/verify-claim.sh` and constitutes
a tamper-evident record of authorship at the time of signing.
See `protocol/CLAIMS.md` for the formal model.
